    <string name="meditation_about_text">Meditation is a practice of mindfulness and relaxation. It helps reduce stress, improve focus and sleep. Start with 5–10 minutes, breathe evenly, observe sensations.</string>
    <string name="meditation_how_to_text">Sit comfortably with a straight back. Close your eyes. Breathe calmly. Do not try to “turn off thoughts” — simply observe. If you drift, gently return to your breath.</string>
    <string name="breathing_how_help_text">Increases heart rate variability, improves focus, accelerates relaxation. Recommended 2–3 times a day for 3–5 minutes.</string>

